.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBEditableText\fR: text that is read until you ask to change it. A long text is clamped to a few lines (\fBSpoiler\fR) and \fBpushes what is below it down\fR when expanded; an edit button swaps it for an \fBEntry\fR, and Enter or the check button finishes.
.PP
One piece of content, two variants chosen by the application's \fBediting\fR flag with the same rules a \fBMetaComponent\fR uses, built with \fBflow\fR so the result takes the height of its content instead of filling its container. While the value is empty a dimmed placeholder stands in, and is itself the edit button.
.PP
.nf
.RS
EditableText::new(&self.bio, Msg::Bio)
    .placeholder("Add a description")
    .editing(self.editing)
    .expanded(self.expanded)
    .on_edit(Msg::Edit)
    .on_done(Msg::Done)
    .on_expand(Msg::Expand)
.RE
.fi
